@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Pengguna as User
boundary HalamanDirektoriMemberUI as DirektoriUI
control DirektoriController as Controller
entity MemberProvider as Member

== Main Flow ==

User -> DirektoriUI : 1: Buka halaman direktori member atau klik menu Member di navigasi
activate DirektoriUI
DirektoriUI -> Controller : 1.1: muatDaftarMember()
activate Controller
Controller -> Member : 1.1.1: ambilSemuaMember()
activate Member

alt [Ada member]
    Member --> Controller : 1.1.2: Daftar semua member
    Controller --> DirektoriUI : 1.1.3: Data member
    DirektoriUI --> User : 1.1.4: Tampilkan grid member\n(avatar, nama, bio singkat, badge role, statistik)\ntombol Lihat Profil\nfilter (All, Active Writers, New Members)\nsearch bar
    
    User -> DirektoriUI : 2: Memfilter atau mencari member
    DirektoriUI -> Controller : 2.1: filterMember(kriteria)
    Controller -> Member : 2.1.1: cariMember(kriteria)
    Member --> Controller : 2.1.2: Member terfilter
    Controller --> DirektoriUI : 2.1.3: Data member terfilter
    DirektoriUI --> User : 2.1.4: Memfilter grid
else [Tidak ada member]
    Member --> Controller : 1.1.2a: Tidak ada member
    Controller --> DirektoriUI : 1.1.3a: Tidak ada data
    DirektoriUI --> User : 1.1.4a: Pesan "Belum ada member"
end

deactivate Member
deactivate Controller
deactivate DirektoriUI

@enduml
